      {
        title: "Favoring Gamers",
        copy: "Mining requirements were carefully picked to place consumer gaming PCs in the efficiency sweetspot. Paired with the fact that farms can't grab major profits, these go to the little guy. ",
        icon: "gamers",
      },
      {
        title: "Democratized Mining",
        copy: "Our mining algorithm brings us close to Satoshi's original vision of \"one-cpu-one-vote\": Mining rewards consumer hardware, not whoever can throw the most ASICs at the network.",
        iconSrc: Group.src,
