    status: "testnet",
    lede: "Instead of implementing DeFi on top of smart contracts, Warthog embeds the DeFi code directly into the consensus layer to open the door to unprecedented features.",
    points: [
      {
        title: "User Protection",
        copy: "Dirty tricks such as post-creation supply inflation, MEV extraction or other rug-pull backdoors are impossible by design. Tokenomics will be reported by Warthog itself and not by sketchy meme coin websites.",
        icon: "userProtection",
      },
      {
        title: "Unique Features",
        copy: "Implementing DeFi natively unlocks features the world has not seen before such as our Fair Batch Matching algorithm or token forks where new tokens are created with balance cloned from existing tokens (planned).",
